{
	"figures": [
		{
			"id": "text-overflow",
			"kind": "scene",
			"shows": "The game UI over a dark backdrop: a wrapped text aligned Left, Center and Right in three boxes; one long text whose lines that do not fit run out below its box with Overflow, stop after two lines with Truncate and end with three dots with Ellipsis; and the words Text over tiles in white over white and blue tiles, without an outline and with a black outline of width 0.08",
			"caption": "Texts in rects of equal size, each with its setting above it. Overflow draws the lines that do not fit below the rect, Truncate keeps the two that fit, and Ellipsis ends the second with three dots. Over patterned tiles, the plain text fades and the outlined one stays clear.",
			"alt": "Three boxes at the top hold the same three lines, aligned left, centered and right. Below, one long text runs two lines past its box in the first, stops at two lines in the second and ends with three dots in the third. At the bottom, the words Text over tiles stand twice over white and blue tiles: plain white and hard to read, then with a black outline.",
